    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Qubicks</strong> is where <strong>tower defense</strong> meets <strong>roguelike</strong> in a stunning voxel-based world. Venture across procedurally generated 3D landscapes as you collect and deploy a variety of powerful towers, all drawn from a randomized deck of cards. Defend human researchers from waves of relentless alien inhabitants as you explore the diverse environments of newly discovered planets.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Replayability:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/70d0a8a1b4ce9d9e2518d62cf0929f88.poster.avif?t=1749821387\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/70d0a8a1b4ce9d9e2518d62cf0929f88.webm?t=1749821387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/70d0a8a1b4ce9d9e2518d62cf0929f88.mp4?t=1749821387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every run is unique with procedurally generated levels and an ever-expanding roster of unlockable towers, heroes, and achievements. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Deck-Building:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/fe3b88cf5325162984aec0608e4d7a2f.poster.avif?t=1749821387\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/fe3b88cf5325162984aec0608e4d7a2f.webm?t=1749821387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/fe3b88cf5325162984aec0608e4d7a2f.mp4?t=1749821387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match cards to build your perfect defense strategy. Will you focus on high-damage towers, or create a maze to stall your enemies? The choice is yours. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adaptive Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/6282316cafb80aa7d4a06a4f5eb6f2f7.poster.avif?t=1749821387\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/6282316cafb80aa7d4a06a4f5eb6f2f7.webm?t=1749821387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/6282316cafb80aa7d4a06a4f5eb6f2f7.mp4?t=1749821387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Qubicks is designed to be both challenging and relaxing, offering a satisfying experience for both hardcore gamers and those looking for a casual gaming session. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Heroes &amp; Special Abilities:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/002744c9a776c2d1e0fb70fb85d5a1d6.poster.avif?t=1749821387\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/002744c9a776c2d1e0fb70fb85d5a1d6.webm?t=1749821387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/002744c9a776c2d1e0fb70fb85d5a1d6.mp4?t=1749821387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and command a diverse cast of heroes, each bringing their own powerful abilities and playstyles to the battlefield. From summoning elemental storms to boosting tower efficiency, these heroes are your ultimate allies in turning the tide of battle and crafting unforgettable strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic 3D Environments:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across beautifully rendered voxel planets, each presenting its own set of challenges and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Play Qubicks?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a fan of games that blend strategy with randomness and love the thrill of building your own defenses while adapting to new situations, Qubicks will be your next obsession. It\u2019s perfect for players who appreciate the depth of a roguelike and the strategy of a tower defense game, all packed into a visually striking, voxel art style.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Qubicks</strong> is where <strong>tower defense</strong> meets <strong>roguelike</strong> in a stunning voxel-based world. Venture across procedurally generated 3D landscapes as you collect and deploy a variety of powerful towers, all drawn from a randomized deck of cards. Defend human researchers from waves of relentless alien inhabitants as you explore the diverse environments of newly discovered planets.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Replayability:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/70d0a8a1b4ce9d9e2518d62cf0929f88.poster.avif?t=1749821387\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/70d0a8a1b4ce9d9e2518d62cf0929f88.webm?t=1749821387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/70d0a8a1b4ce9d9e2518d62cf0929f88.mp4?t=1749821387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every run is unique with procedurally generated levels and an ever-expanding roster of unlockable towers, heroes, and achievements. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Deck-Building:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/fe3b88cf5325162984aec0608e4d7a2f.poster.avif?t=1749821387\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/fe3b88cf5325162984aec0608e4d7a2f.webm?t=1749821387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/fe3b88cf5325162984aec0608e4d7a2f.mp4?t=1749821387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match cards to build your perfect defense strategy. Will you focus on high-damage towers, or create a maze to stall your enemies? The choice is yours. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adaptive Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/6282316cafb80aa7d4a06a4f5eb6f2f7.poster.avif?t=1749821387\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/6282316cafb80aa7d4a06a4f5eb6f2f7.webm?t=1749821387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/6282316cafb80aa7d4a06a4f5eb6f2f7.mp4?t=1749821387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Qubicks is designed to be both challenging and relaxing, offering a satisfying experience for both hardcore gamers and those looking for a casual gaming session. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Heroes &amp; Special Abilities:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/002744c9a776c2d1e0fb70fb85d5a1d6.poster.avif?t=1749821387\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/002744c9a776c2d1e0fb70fb85d5a1d6.webm?t=1749821387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135350/extras/002744c9a776c2d1e0fb70fb85d5a1d6.mp4?t=1749821387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and command a diverse cast of heroes, each bringing their own powerful abilities and playstyles to the battlefield. From summoning elemental storms to boosting tower efficiency, these heroes are your ultimate allies in turning the tide of battle and crafting unforgettable strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic 3D Environments:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across beautifully rendered voxel planets, each presenting its own set of challenges and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Play Qubicks?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a fan of games that blend strategy with randomness and love the thrill of building your own defenses while adapting to new situations, Qubicks will be your next obsession. It\u2019s perfect for players who appreciate the depth of a roguelike and the strategy of a tower defense game, all packed into a visually striking, voxel art style.</p>",
    "short_description": "Qubicks is where tower defense meets roguelike as you venture across procedurally generated levels where you strategically position towers, balancing immediate survival with long-term growth. Upgrade your towers and heroes to adapt to difficult waves and ensure victory against alien inhabitants.",
